\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces Computational graph of one ArchesWeather forecast step. The deterministic model produces the base forecast $\hat {x}^{\mathrm {det}}_n$, while the flow model generates the residual through $T$ sampling steps before both components are combined. \relax }}{21}{figure.caption.8}%
